{% extends 'dashboard/help/_topic.html.twig' %}
{% block content %}
<p>Start with <a href="{{ path('dashboard_operator_diagnostics') }}">Diagnostics</a>: every FAIL and WARN says what it means and what to do. Then:</p>
<table class="dense"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Symptom</th><th scope="col">Look at</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>Nothing is sent</td><td>Delivery mode (HELD? PAUSED? STOPPED?); the client's status; the send job's status; <code>prod logs delivery</code>.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Sent but deferred</td><td>The receiver's message in the message timeline; PTR, SPF, DKIM, DMARC checks; the reputation page; lower the rate.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Many hard bounces</td><td>The list's quality: validate it, remove old addresses; the bounce rate alert.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Bounces are not recorded</td><td>The bounce domain's MX; inbound port 25 (provider, firewall); <code>prod logs postfix</code>; Mail flow › Unmatched DSNs.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Validation never finishes</td><td>The validator heartbeat check; DNS from the server; retries can take up to a few hours for temporary failures.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Sign-in mail does not arrive</td><td>Use the host-printed link: <code>smarthostctl prod admin-link</code>; then check the sign-in sender's DKIM and the delivery mode (sign-in mail is sent even in HELD mode).</td></tr>
<tr><td>Certificate errors</td><td>TLS checks; <code>prod tls acme renew</code>; the DNS provider credentials.</td></tr>
<tr><td>A checks page says "host agent never reported"</td><td>As cattomail: <code>systemctl --user status smarthost-host-agent.service</code>; <code>prod install</code> installs it.</td></tr>
<tr><td>After a reboot nothing runs</td><td>See <a href="{{ path('dashboard_operator_help_topic', {topic: 'reboot'}) }}">Automatic start</a>.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Disk full</td><td>Old backups (<code>BACKUP_KEEP</code>), Postfix queue size, logs; <code>df -h</code>.</td></tr>
</tbody></table>
<p>Containers: <code>smarthostctl prod status</code>; a single component can be recreated with <code>smarthostctl prod replace &lt;component&gt;</code> (data is kept).</p>
{% endblock %}
